{"reviews":[{"id":"B001281404-0","r":4.0,"t":"These do work!","x":"I am being teased about looking like Grandma with this gear...but the darn thing works if you don't want a hat jammed on your head and holding an umbrella uses up one hand. Mainly I use this when taking our dogs out for their &#34;constitution. &#34; I would have given it a 5 star but the ties should be about 1 to 2 inches longer each, making it harder to tie...especially when dogs are letting you know the time is NOW. Still, I just ordered the pack of three for backup and convenience.","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B001281404-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great Rain Bonnet","x":"My mother gets her hair fixed once a week, and she depends on this rain bonnet for rainy days.  It covers her entire head and works.  I recommend this for anyone who likes to protect beauty parlor hair in the rain.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2010"},{"id":"B001281404-2","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful!","x":"Young women used to laugh at us older gals for wearing these scarfs. Now, they want to know where to buy them. Nothing protects your beautiful hair style better than these. Thanks.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B001281404-3","r":5.0,"t":"If caught without umbrella,easy to carry","x":"Easy to keep in purse and pull out if raining. Has additional protection in front","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B001281404-4","r":5.0,"t":"great to keep in purse","x":"i could not find these rain hats in any of the usual places here in the tampa bay area. so my last resort was amazon.com thinking it was too small an item. so was suprised to find them at such a reasonable price. they do work and fit well and i have used them many times durning this rainy season. wish they still came in a small plastic pouch but a small plastic bag works well to keep in your purse.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2012"},{"id":"B001281404-5","r":4.0,"t":"Rainhats","x":"Just what my 93 year old mom wanted EXCEPT that we did not expect them to be pink and blue. From what we saw and read we thought they would all be clear.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2012"},{"id":"B001281404-6","r":5.0,"t":"Rain bonnets","x":"Rain bonnets are a real necessity in Seattle in the fall and winter. I was super happy to find them on your website. I am amazed that they are not easily avilable here--but they aren't!! Thank you VERY MUCH. Barbara J Hoover","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2009"},{"id":"B001281404-7","r":3.0,"t":"Rain Bonnet","x":"I like the shape of this rain bonnet, but the material is noisy. It needs to be made of a softer material.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2011"},{"id":"B001281404-8","r":4.0,"t":"couldn't find them at stores and was glad to find these","x":"Just as pictured, couldn't find them at stores and was glad to find these.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B001281404-9","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Product description states that this bonnet has a snap closure. It does not; it ties under the chin.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B001281404-10","r":5.0,"t":"HANDY!","x":"It is nice to have a rain-bonnet tucked into my handbag for those times is rains without warning ESPECIALLY when trying to leave a store or salon! When it seemed as if NO LOCAL MERCHANT carried these, I was VERY pleasantly surprised to find them on Amazon, and at a great price, too! I bought SEVERAL! (one for each vehicle, piece of luggage, you get the idea)","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B001281404-11","r":5.0,"t":"Compact and comfortable","x":"A compact and comfortable, you are always prepared for a rain shower. Just like Grandma's rain hat that she kept in her purse at all times. Thought it was funny when I was younger, but now I love my Rain Bonnet.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2013"},{"id":"B001281404-12","r":5.0,"t":"It works!","x":"Old time rain bonnet,  but does the job I need it to do! Keeps my head dry on a wet day when it's too warm out for a jacket","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B001281404-13","r":1.0,"t":"it ties just like all the others","x":"NO SNAPS.  I bought this specifically because I needed a rain bonnet with snaps, and the description very clearly states that this has snap closure.  Don't believe it...it ties just like all the others.  Really annoyed because I paid for express shipping because I so immediately needed a bonnet for my mother--in-law that SNAPPED closed.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2015"},{"id":"B001281404-14","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Perfect gift for my mother who does not like to get her hair wet!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B001281404-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great hair bonnet!","x":"Perfect rain bonnet to protect my hair from the rain.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B001281404-16","r":5.0,"t":"The Cadillac of blue hair protectors.","x":"I bought granny two and she still won't dye it blue.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B001281404-17","r":5.0,"t":"Just right","x":"I had one of these several years ago and lost it. I had been looking to replace it for some time and was happy to find one. Hope to use it this week as weather has been good lately but we're expecting a change..","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B001281404-18","r":5.0,"t":"Looks like a good rain bonnet","x":"It looks great. But I never tried it yet! I have been carrying around in my purse for months! I\u2019m not sure why I ordered it on line when I could have bought it at walmart\ud83d\ude42","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B001281404-19","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent for anytime use","x":"Excellent for anytime use.  Now I keep it in my purse as it's small.  Having the visor really keeps the rain out. Received product sooner than expected.  Great product!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B001281404-20","r":5.0,"t":"Handy Way to Keep Dry","x":"I live in Oregon where we get lots of rain.  This is handy for a purse or glove box to prevent you from getting drenched.  I use it often.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2015"},{"id":"B001281404-21","r":1.0,"t":"A total rip off","x":"Not worth the money that I was charged for one and you only get one and its flimsy at best doesn't cover the hair well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B001281404-22","r":3.0,"t":"Rain Bonnet.","x":"I had hoped it would have had a snap instead of tie under your chin, but otherwise for the price it's adequate.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B001281404-23","r":5.0,"t":"Rain bonnet kept me dry!","x":"The rain bonnet exceeded all expectations! Much better than I expected.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B001281404-24","r":4.0,"t":"Great when caught in the rain without an umbrella.","x":"Serves the purpose.  Fits in my purse when I don't have an unbrella.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently say the bonnet works well for keeping hair and head dry in the rain.","cites":[1,2,3,5,13,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers value how compact and easy it is to keep in a purse for unexpected rain.","cites":[4,5,11,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers were glad to find the product online because local stores did not carry it.","cites":[5,7,9,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain that the product ties under the chin rather than having the advertised snap closure.","cites":[10,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the material is noisy or that colors differed from expectations.","cites":[6,8]}]},"qa":[]}